codex
All eight checks now pass and `python check.py` prints `ALL OK`.

The fixes were: `shapes.rect_area` now multiplies dimensions instead of adding them; `strings.slugify` collapses arbitrary whitespace into one hyphen; `strings.truncate` reserves three characters for the ellipsis; `numbers_util.median` sorts values and averages the two middle values for even-length input; `numbers_util.clamp` enforces both lower and upper bounds; and `dates.py` uses the Gregorian leap-year rule plus the month-to-quarter mapping `(month - 1) // 3 + 1`.
